From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] gridcraft: Cargo.lock lists web-sys under suite-core

suite-core (crates/suite-core) reads the web toolbar choice from localStorage and the URL on wasm32, so it depends on web-sys there;
Cargo.lock only (web-sys, js-sys and wasm-bindgen are already in this lock).
---

diff --git a/Cargo.lock b/Cargo.lock
index 9698561e..50ca9fcc 100644
--- a/Cargo.lock
+++ b/Cargo.lock
@@ -3455,6 +3455,7 @@ dependencies = [
  "serde_json",
  "sha2 0.10.9",
  "toml_edit 0.22.27",
+ "web-sys",
 ]
 
 [[package]]
